OL,3,GNEWSA'Everywoman' statue unveiled in
OL,4,ATrafalgar Square
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sculpture inspired by a desire to
OL,7,Fbring a contemporary "everywoman" to
OL,8,FTrafalgar Square has been unveiled on
OL,9,FLondon's Fourth Plinth.
OL,11,FLady In Blue by New York artist
OL,12,FTschabalala Self, which pays homage to
OL,13,Fa young, metropolitan woman, is the
OL,14,F16th artwork to feature on the plinth
OL,15,Fsince 1998.
OL,17,FThe bronze and blue figure replaces Mil
OL,18,FVeces un Instante (A Thousand Times in
OL,19,Fan Instant) by Teresa Margolles.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
