OL,3,GNEWSA'Everywoman' statue unveiled in
OL,4,ATrafalgar Square
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe statue has been patinated with a
OL,7,Fpigment refined from Lapis Lazuli, a
OL,8,Fsemi-precious stone that has been used
OL,9,Fby artists for millennia.
